<section class="product-preview" aria-labelledby="preview-title">
  <div><p class="section-eyebrow">One dashboard, one next step</p><h2 id="preview-title">See what is live and what needs attention.</h2><p class="text-muted">Deployment state, the application address, and the recommended next action stay together.</p></div>
