</section>

<section class="public-section" aria-labelledby="compatibility-title">
  <p class="section-eyebrow">Compatibility</p><h2 id="compatibility-title">Can HelloDeploy deploy your project?</h2>
  <div class="compatibility-grid mt-4"><div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3>Supported</h3><ul><li>Static HTML/CSS/JS</li><li>Node.js and Express</li><li>React and Vue static builds</li><li>Constrained Next.js</li></ul></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3>Not currently supported</h3><ul><li>Python, PHP, or Java</li><li>Docker Compose</li><li>Arbitrary images</li><li>Privileged containers</li></ul></div></div></div>
  <a href="/supported-apps" class="button button--secondary mt-4">View full support matrix</a>
</section>

<section class="public-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title"><p class="section-eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 id="how-title">From repository to live URL</h2><div class="feature-grid mt-4">
  <% [['1','Connect repository','Choose a public repository or authorize the GitHub App.'],['2','Confirm app setup','Review the detected application type and settings.'],['3','Deploy','Publish an approved commit while HelloDeploy reports progress.'],['4','Open the live app','Use the project address after health checks pass.']].forEach(step => { %><div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%= step[0] %></span> <%= step[1] %></h3><p class="text-sm text-muted"><%= step[2] %></p></div></div><% }) %>
</div><a href="/how-it-works" class="button button--secondary mt-4">Explore the full workflow</a></section>

<section class="public-section" aria-labelledby="handles-title"><p class="section-eyebrow">What HelloDeploy handles</p><h2 id="handles-title">The common deployment work, in one place</h2><div class="feature-grid mt-4">
  <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'repository' }) %></span> Connect</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted">Repository access and app detection.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'deploy' }) %></span> Deploy</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted">Progress, health checks, history, and rollback.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'environment' }) %></span> Configure</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted">Write-only environment values with detected names.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'domain' }) %></span> Publish</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted">A platform address and verified custom domains.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'users' }) %></span> Collaborate</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted">Clear project roles and ownership controls.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><h3 class="feature-title"><span class="feature-icon"><%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'audit' }) %></span> Review</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted">An audit history of important actions.</p></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="public-section" aria-labelledby="trust-title"><p class="section-eyebrow">Trust and expectations</p><h2 id="trust-title">Clear controls without exaggerated promises</h2><div class="trust-grid mt-4"><div><strong>Encrypted secrets</strong><span>Protected at rest and redacted from logs.</span></div><div><strong>Verified accounts</strong><span>Email verification before platform access.</span></div><div><strong>Isolated releases</strong><span>Bounded, non-privileged application containers.</span></div><div><strong>Audit history</strong><span>Important configuration and admin actions recorded.</span></div><div><strong>Pilot service</strong><span>Free within published limits, without an SLA.</span></div><div><strong>Named operator</strong><span>Operated by Henson Sagorsor / 4HProjects.</span></div></div></section>

